  "id": "17251208155d9b92bfdd7e47",
  "title": "自學鋼琴：用圖形記憶，彈奏 Major Pentachord",
  "summary": "前言 # 爲了幫自己彈奏發聲練習的音階，於是開始研究怎麼快速背好 12 key 音階，由於吉他手大多是使用首調（相對音）唱名，所以遇到鋼琴的固定調（絕對音）思維會很痛苦，最終用吉他手也很熟悉的圖形記憶方式來記憶音階、和弦。 練唱的其中一個最常見的音階，是使用「大調音階的前五個音」來練習，也就是 Major Pentachord。 你的瀏覽器不支援影片播放。 ## Pentachord Penta 是 5 的意思，而 Chord 應該要是和弦的意思，但是 Pentachord 是指「5 個音的音階」，但是跟五聲音階「Pentatonic Scale」又是兩個完全不同的東西。 Pentachord 其實很簡單，以 C Major Triad 和弦舉例： 組成音是 C E G，而 C Major Pentachor…",
  "content": "<h2>\n  前言\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>爲了幫自己彈奏發聲練習的音階，於是開始研究怎麼快速背好 12 key 音階，由於吉他手大多是使用首調（相對音）唱名，所以遇到鋼琴的固定調（絕對音）思維會很痛苦，最終用吉他手也很熟悉的圖形記憶方式來記憶音階、和弦。</p>\n<p>練唱的其中一個最常見的音階，是使用「大調音階的前五個音」來練習，也就是 Major Pentachord。</p>\n\n  \n  你的瀏覽器不支援影片播放。\n\n## Pentachord\nPenta 是 5 的意思，而 Chord 應該要是和弦的意思，但是 Pentachord 是指「5 個音的音階」，但是跟五聲音階「Pentatonic Scale」又是兩個完全不同的東西。\n<p>Pentachord 其實很簡單，以 C Major Triad 和弦舉例：</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>組成音是 C E G，而 C Major Pentachord 則是指 C D E F G。\n<div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>概念其實很簡單，就是把大二度音、完全四度音補上而已。</p>\n<p>如果是 C minor Penatachord 則是指 C D Eb F G。</p>\n<h2>\n  圖形搭配相對音、首調思維\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>Eddie 馬上就要能彈，而且彈的時候思維要完全在練習唱歌上，而不是在想鋼琴要彈什麼音，因此決定使用圖形方式記憶，最終也在一個小時內就大致上背完，覺得非常有用。</p>\n<h2>\n  分類法\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>Eddie 把圖形先拆成「根音在白鍵」與「根音在黑鍵」兩組。</p>\n<p>練習的階段一是學會彈 12 種根音的 Major Triad Chord，階段二才是彈奏 12 種根音的 Major Pentachord。</p>\n<h2>\n  階段一：Major Chord\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<h3>\n  根音在白鍵的 Major Chord\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>記憶口訣：C、F、G 全白鍵，D、E、A 中指黑鍵，B 只有根音是白鍵。</p>\n<p>而 Eddie 其實是用數字 145、236、7 來分組記憶，如果有級數概念的同學應該會對這串數字很熟悉，甚至可以理解黑鍵的出現的原因，這裡先不做解釋樂理，以能夠快速背起來爲主！</p>\n<h4>\n  145 全白鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>非常簡單，每個音之間都是隔一個白鍵。</p>\n<p>C Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>F Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/f-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/f-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>G Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/g-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/g-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h4>\n  236 中指黑鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>可以先利用全白鍵的手形，再把中指往右邊移動到黑鍵。</p>\n<p>D Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/d-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/d-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>E Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/e-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/e-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>A Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/a-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/a-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h4>\n  7 只有根音是白鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>可以先利用全白鍵的手型，把中指、小指往右邊移動一個黑鍵。</p>\n<p>B Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/b-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/b-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h3>\n  根音在黑鍵的 Major Chord\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>記憶口訣：Gb 全黑鍵，Db、Eb、Ab 中指白鍵，Bb 只有根音是黑鍵。</p>\n<h4>\n  5 全黑鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>Gb/F# Major：爲了分類 Eddie 建議用 F# ，到 Pentachord 的部分會就知道了。</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/gb-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/gb-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h4>\n  236 中指白鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>Db Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/db-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/db-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>Eb Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/eb-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/eb-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>Ab Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/ab-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/ab-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h4>\n  7 只有根音是黑鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>Bb Major</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/bb-triad.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/bb-triad.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h2>\n  階段二：Major Pentachord\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>基本上補上大二度與完全四度即可，可以直接記圖就好，會樂理可用樂理推算。</p>\n<h3>\n  根音在白鍵的 Major Pentachord\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>分組基本上還是 145、236 、7，但是 4 與 3 會變化，其中 4 形成最獨特的無名指黑鍵，3 則形成食指黑鍵。</p>\n<h4>\n  1(4)5 全白鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>C Major Pentachord\n<div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/c-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>F Major Pentachord：無名指往右移動黑鍵，形成一個黑鍵的圖形。\n<div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/f-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/f-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>G Major Pentachord</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/g-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/g-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h4>\n  2(3)6 中指黑鍵\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>D Major Pentachord</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/d-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/d-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>E Major Pentachord：食指往右移動一個黑鍵，形成 2 個黑鍵的圖形</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/e-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/e-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>A Major Pentachord</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/a-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/a-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h4>\n  7\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>B major Pentachord：有三個黑鍵\n<div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/b-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/b-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h3>\n  根音在黑鍵的 Major Pentachord\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h3>\n\n<p>黑鍵爲根音的情況，通常情況下是用降調號，Eddie 爲了歸類圖形，只會用到一個 F# 的升調號。</p>\n<h4>\n  4\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>F# major Pentachord：</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/gb-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/gb-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>在 F 的 major Pentachord 時，是把無名指往右移動到黑鍵，而 F# 則是往右移動到白鍵。</p>\n<p>15 的部分因爲使用降調號，所以就消失了！（用 Db 不用 C#；用 Ab 不用 G#）</p>\n<h4>\n  236\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>Db major Pentachord：</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/db-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/db-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>Ab major Pentachord：</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/ab-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/ab-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>Eb major Pentachord：2 個白鍵</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/eb-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/eb-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<p>E major pentachord 時爲兩個黑鍵，Eb 則會變成兩個白鍵。</p>\n<h4>\n  7\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h4>\n\n<p>Bb major Pentachord：</p>\n<p><div>\n  <a href=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/bb-pentachord.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <img src=\"https://eddielv.com/articles/piano-major-pentachord/bb-pentachord.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n  </a>\n  \n  \n</div></p>\n<h2>\n  結論\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> #</a>\n</h2>\n\n<p>Eddie 練習的順序是：先練習 Chord，再練習 Pentachord；<br>\n先練習白鍵爲根音的，再練習黑鍵爲根音的。</p>\n<p>Eddie 並沒有思考任何音高，純粹是以圖形記憶，一小時左右就能背完。</p>\n<p>等到 Eddie 完成完整的八度音大調音階，再另外寫一篇！</p>",
